schema fpml514RecordkeepingXML XML <" A schema representing how to serialize/deserialize fpml-5-14-recordkeeping samples. Use it in a function annotation such as `[ingest fpml514RecordkeepingXML]` or `[projection fpml514RecordkeepingXML]`. For more information, see https://rune.finos.org/docs/modelling-components/schema">
